# ============================================================================
#  LINE COOK STATION: CONTRABAND (shady-stash entries)
# ============================================================================
# List files or folders that will get added to the "stash" for going shady.
# These are the files and folders that get moved into __stash__ and turned
# into symlinks - not just gitignored, actually stashed and portable.
#
# Rule: everything listed here must also be listed in .countertop, so it
# actually gets gitignored (a stash symlink tracked by git would be broken
# on every other machine).

# Example:
# CLAUDE.local.md
